# SHIFT (black key 11) + a white key 1-16 changes to that pattern, on any Tonic page: stopped = at once, playing = at the
# end of the bar (cued). The SONG page and song mode: nothing (the song decides). Black key 9 and 10 are not touched.
wait 300
expect ppat0 1
key b10 down
tapkey w2
key b10 up
expect ppat0 3
# no step was written by it (the white key only changed the pattern)
tap EDIT
key b10 down
tapkey w5
key b10 up
expect ppat0 6
shot shiftpat_1.png
# playing: it is cued, then taken at the end of the bar
tap PLAY
wait 200
key b10 down
tapkey w8
key b10 up
expect cue 9
expect ppat0 6
wait 4000
expect ppat0 9
tap PLAY
wait 200
# the SONG page: nothing
tap HOME
tap HOME
expect view 6
key b10 down
tapkey w3
key b10 up
expect ppat0 9
# a plain white key still works as before on the HOME page (a pattern)
# song mode: nothing
songmode 1
tap EDIT
key b10 down
tapkey w4
key b10 up
expect ppat0 9
